B.aNb=new A.dZ("path_introductions_01","Presentaciones","Introductions","A1","\ud83d\udc4b",B.aJg,"Para presentarte en ingl\xe9s, usa estas frases esenciales:\n\n\u2022 My name is... = Me llamo... / Mi nombre es...\n\u2022 I am from... = Soy de...\n\u2022 I am... years old = Tengo... a\xf1os\n\nRecuerda: En ingl\xe9s siempre se escribe 'I' (yo) en may\xfascula.\n\nPara preguntar el nombre de alguien:\n\u2022 What is your name? = \xbfC\xf3mo te llamas?\n\u2022 Where are you from? = \xbfDe d\xf3nde eres?",'"Hello! My name is Carlos. I am from Mexico. Nice to meet you!"','You are a friendly neighbor named Linda meeting someone new at an apartment building.\nThe student is a Spanish speaker practicing English introductions.\n\nRULES:\n- Be warm and welcoming \u2014 short, natural lines (1-2 sentences)\n- Ask their name, where they are from, and how long they have lived here\n- Share a little about yourself in return\n- After 6 exchanges, wrap up the conversation naturally\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they used correct English introductions; "amber" if understandable but with errors; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true on your natural closing line',"Linda","Vecina amigable","Oh, hello there! Are you the new neighbor? I'm Linda \u2014 so nice to meet you!","Saluda a tu vecina y pres\xe9ntate en ingl\xe9s \u2014 di tu nombre y de d\xf3nde eres.",6,"Presentarte y saludar a alguien nuevo en ingl\xe9s",B.aIR)
B.aZL=new A.cu("Meeting","Reuni\xf3n / Junta","We have a meeting at 9 a.m.")
B.aZQ=new A.cu("Boss","Jefe / Jefa","My boss is very friendly.")
B.aZX=new A.cu("Schedule","Horario","What is your work schedule this week?")
B.b_d=new A.cu("Office","Oficina","Please come to the office by 8 a.m.")
B.b_e=new A.cu("Coworker","Compa\xf1ero de trabajo","My coworkers are very helpful.")
B.aZS=new A.cu("Email","Correo electr\xf3nico","I will send you an email with the details.")
B.b_0=new A.cu("On time","A tiempo / Puntual","It is important to arrive on time.")
B.aId=s([B.aZL,B.aZQ,B.aZX,B.b_d,B.b_e,B.aZS,B.b_0],t.xN)
